```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant GH as GitHub (membership event)
    participant Action as GitHub Action
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant CLI as wow CLI
    participant Issue as GitHub Issue

    GH->>Action: membership: added (new member joins team)
    Action->>Repo: actions/checkout

    Action->>CLI: wow show --trigger onboarding --format markdown
    CLI->>Repo: Read wow/config.yaml
    Repo-->>CLI: File manifest
    CLI->>CLI: Filter files where applies_to includes "onboarding"
    CLI->>Repo: Load matching WoW files
    Repo-->>CLI: Rule content (DoD, code review, architecture, etc.)
    CLI-->>Action: Rendered markdown digest

    Action->>Issue: Create issue (peter-evans/create-issue-from-file)
    Note over Issue: Title: "👋 Welcome! Review our team ways of working"
    Note over Issue: Assigned to: new member
    Note over Issue: Labels: onboarding
    Issue-->>GH: New member sees issue in their notifications
```
